<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκμηνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of six months, half-yearly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκμήνους χρόνους</span> (Pors. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμήνους</span>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1137
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					558a17
				</span></i>
			 : Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκμηνος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>half-year,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς ἑκμήνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					916b
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἑγμήνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).207.52
				</span></i>
			 (Eretria, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				59.6
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span>), ἡ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.34.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>six months old,</i> of an animal, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				562b27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ πρεσβύτερον ἐνιαυσίου καὶ ἑγμήνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).647.8
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Ceos</span>).</div>
